The '''Habitat Dex''' is a feature in [[Pokémon Pokopia]] that catalogs the various habitats in which [[List of Pokémon by Pokopia Pokédex number|Pokémon]] can be found. As the player explores the world, new habitats are registered to the Habitat Dex.

